---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="sYnID"
	description="Universal Single Sign-On (SSO) and OpenID Connect identity provider deployed at the edge."
>
	<p>
		<strong>sYnID</strong> is a centralized authentication provider that acts as a universal single sign-on gateway for applications in the sYnVerse ecosystem. Deployed entirely on Cloudflare Workers, it shares active sessions across subdomains, allowing users to sign in once and access all connected services seamlessly.
	</p>

	<h2>Infrastructure Overview</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Security & Auth Core</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Framework</td><td>OpenAuth.js (@openauthjs/openauth)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Runtime</td><td>Cloudflare Workers</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Schema Validator</td><td>Valibot</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Bot Shield</td><td>Cloudflare Turnstile CAPTCHA</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Data & Storage</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">User Database</td><td>Cloudflare D1 (SQL)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Session Cache</td><td>Cloudflare KV Storage</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Email Integration</td><td>Resend API (automated verification & reset)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Language</td><td>TypeScript</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Shared-Domain Auto-Login:</strong> By leveraging parent domain session cookies, sYnID shares one-time authorization tokens across subdomains, instantly logging in users as they navigate between applications without redirect delays.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Core Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Multi-Provider Authentication</strong> — Integrates classic Email/Password credentials, Google OAuth, GitHub OAuth, and Microsoft Entra ID.</li>
		<li><strong>Account Linking</strong> — Allows users to bind multiple OAuth credentials to a single email address, preventing duplicate accounts.</li>
		<li><strong>Post-Based Central Logout</strong> — Features a secure, POST-verified logout endpoint that clears cookies across all linked client applications.</li>
		<li><strong>Security Hardening</strong> — Protects endpoints with Turnstile CAPTCHA (featuring automatic rate-limit token resets) and prevents browser predictive prefetching from accidentally executing sign-outs.</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare Workers</span>
		<span class="tag">OpenAuth.js</span>
		<span class="tag">D1 Database</span>
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare Turnstile</span>
		<span class="tag">Valibot</span>
		<span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
		<span class="tag">OAuth 2.0</span>
		<span class="tag">SSO</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
